-------------------------------------------------------------------------
xoshiro256++
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files:      src/zurand.c, xoshiro_sub_scalar() and the AVX2 and NEON
            xoshiro_group_*() functions (the recurrence)
Copyright:  None: dedicated to the public domain by its authors
Source:     https://prng.di.unimi.it/xoshiro256plusplus.c

The xoshiro256++ recurrence follows David Blackman and Sebastiano Vigna's
reference implementation (written in 2019), which they dedicated to the
public domain. Reference: D. Blackman and S. Vigna (2021), "Scrambled
linear pseudorandom number generators", ACM Transactions on Mathematical
Software 47(4), 1-32, <doi:10.1145/3460772>. Seeding each 512-value
sub-chunk from Philox and the vector paths are zurand's own.


